  "common-default-rails/sine": "* quiz circuit\n* issue: floating_pin M1.B\n* issue: duplicate_name R2\n* issue: floating_pin R2.C\n* issue: floating_pin R2.B\n* issue: floating_pin R2.E\n* issue: duplicate_name R2\n* issue: unconnected_port in+\nMRload 0 0 n1 n1 PMOSE\nDR2 0 0 DSI\nQM1 0 n2 0 QPNP\nQR2 n3 n4 n5 QPNP\nMR2 0 0 n1 n1 PMOSE\nQL1 n1 0 0 QNPN\n.model DSI D(IS=1e-14 N=1)\n.model PMOSE PMOS(LEVEL=1 VTO=-1 KP=1e-3)\n.model QNPN NPN(BF=100)\n.model QPNP PNP(BF=100)\nVin in 0 SIN(5e-1 1e+0 1e+3)\nRload out outl 1e+12\nVmeas outl 0 0\n.tran 1e-5 5e-3 0\n.control\nset wr_vecnames\nset wr_singlescale\nrun\nlinearize v(in) v(out) i(Vmeas)\nwrdata /dev/stdout v(in) v(out) i(Vmeas)\n.endc\n.end\n",
