  "split-dual-rails/step": "* quiz circuit\n* issue: floating_pin M1.B\n* issue: duplicate_name R2\n* issue: floating_pin R2.C\n* issue: floating_pin R2.B\n* issue: floating_pin R2.E\n* issue: duplicate_name R2\n* issue: unconnected_port in+\n* issue: unconnected_port in-\n* issue: no_ground\nMRload outn outn n1 n1 PMOSE\nDR2 outn outn DSI\nQM1 outn n2 outn QPNP\nQR2 n3 n4 n5 QPNP\nMR2 outn outn n1 n1 PMOSE\nQL1 n1 outn outn QNPN\n.model DSI D(IS=1e-14 N=1)\n.model PMOSE PMOS(LEVEL=1 VTO=-1 KP=1e-3)\n.model QNPN NPN(BF=100)\n.model QPNP PNP(BF=100)\nVcc vcc 0 DC 1.5e+1\nVee vee 0 DC -1.5e+1\nVin src inn PWL(0 0 1e-3 0 1.000001e-3 5e+0)\nRs src in 5e+1\nRload out outl 1e+4\nVmeas outl outn 0\n.tran 4.5e-5 1e-2 1e-3\n.control\nset wr_vecnames\nset wr_singlescale\nrun\nlinearize v(in) v(out) i(Vmeas)\nwrdata /dev/stdout v(in) v(out) i(Vmeas)\n.endc\n.end\n",
